{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-2aba0e13c9d6","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-2aba0e13c9d6","name":"黄油煎虾","category":"aquatic","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/aquatic/%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9%E7%85%8E%E8%99%BE/%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9%E7%85%8E%E8%99%BE.md","blob_sha":"164cd9d74913b478ac3373a6241641badd3f395d","details":{"introduction":"黄油煎虾是一道风味浓郁、虾肉鲜嫩弹牙的家常海鲜菜。鲜虾富含优质蛋白和钙、锌等矿物质，搭配黄油增添了奶香与能量。制作相对简单，只需耐心处理活虾，新手也能顺利上手，总耗时约一小时。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鲜虾（强推肉质紧实的九节虾，普通明虾也可以）\n- 黄油（推荐安佳，一次用一小盒 7g）\n- 黑胡椒粒（瓶磨的那种）\n- 生抽\n- 盐\n- 白糖\n- 米酒"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 鲜虾 300g\n- 黄油 7g\n- 黑胡椒粒 大概 15ml\n- 食用油 45ml\n- 生抽 10ml\n- 米酒 5ml\n- 白糖 10ml\n- 盐 2.5ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 鲜虾摘除头部，顺带扯出虾线（这步处理不好可在下一步开背时取出虾线），使用剪刀剪开或菜刀片开虾背，沥干水分备用\n2. 调制酱汁：小碗放入上述量的全部生抽、米酒、白糖、盐搅匀备用\n3. 中大火热锅，热锅内放入食用油，等待 10 秒让油温升高\n4. 虾全部放入锅中，开始瓶磨黑胡椒，均匀地撒在虾上翻炒\n5. 虾变色后加入黄油，黄油完全融化后倒入调制酱汁，继续翻炒\n6. 大火翻炒 15 秒收汁即可装盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 虾开背才更好入味，不过处理时切记切记小心用刀，新手容易伤到手\n- [冯小厨的菜谱](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1g541177cd)"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳生虾仁350g、无盐黄油25g、去皮大蒜10g、食盐2g；整份约350g。虾净肉，黄油汁全部入盘食用，不含头壳。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":140.471429,"protein_g":20.342429,"carbohydrate_g":0.95,"fat_g":6.317143},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/175179/nutrients","version":"46b1a5ab84ee2567","fdc_ids":[175179,173430,169230,173468]},"profile_id":"family-2aba0e13c9d6-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-2aba0e13c9d6","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-2aba0e13c9d6","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-2aba0e13c9d6-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"shrimp","grams":350},{"key":"butter","grams":25},{"key":"garlic","grams":10},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"46b1a5ab84ee2567","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-2aba0e13c9d6-v1.4d1e519f0f600cea.json","bytes":21046,"sha256":"4d1e519f0f600ceaaad728162c3cc9072c75cd4c512375d9391c12657cef13f1"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-2aba0e13c9d6-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-2aba0e13c9d6","recipe_blob_sha":"164cd9d74913b478ac3373a6241641badd3f395d","version":"1","data_version":"46b1a5ab84ee2567","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":350,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品350g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳生虾仁350g、无盐黄油25g、去皮大蒜10g、食盐2g；整份约350g。虾净肉，黄油汁全部入盘食用，不含头壳。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-2aba0e13c9d6","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-2aba0e13c9d6-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"shrimp","grams":350},{"key":"butter","grams":25},{"key":"garlic","grams":10},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":140.471429,"protein_g":20.342429,"carbohydrate_g":0.95,"fat_g":6.317143},"source":{